        "language": "modern_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "preserve",
        "modern_text": "译文初九，不交往不惹祸，自然不致咎害；但必须牢记艰难才能免遭咎害。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
